Main
--function Main.pi --cp `../../../../scripts/format_classpath.sh . ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/core-models.jar ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/cprover-api.jar`
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
"π".toLowerCase() is "π" in Java. The conversion of characters from U+0100
is not modelled, so the result is unconstrained and the assertion fails, with
a warning that the counterexample may be spurious. (It used to be proved by
leaving such characters unchanged, which is wrong for most letters.)
